      "why": "Friendly, a little upbeat: content gives the smile on 'looks great' (264 Hz, 9.6 st spread) and lands at 5.75 s against the 5.72 s target. Neutral pushed the pitch up to 290 Hz (brighter, less relaxed)."
    },
    "L2": {
