      "accept": {},
      "why": "Matter-of-fact with a beat after \"Wi-Fi.\": neutral at speed 1.0 (216 Hz median, 8.5 st spread, in Cathy’s L1/L4 register) runs 6.45 s against the 6.35 s target, with about 210 ms of silence after \"Wi-Fi\" (silencedetect -45 dB). The earlier pin (calm 1.05, take 0, 6.52 s) was dropped: VibeScribe’s own engine (tools/whisper-check, large-v3, app decode options and the film vocabulary) writes \"back off\" for it, so the app would paste 19 words under an \"18 words\" pill. For this take it writes \"back-off\", which is 18 words, matching the pill. Scan of 20 cached L2 takes: build/audio/l2-scan/results.jsonl.",
      "pin_take": 0
    },
