      "why": "Emotion inferred from the text keeps the afterthought lift on 'Oh, and buy oat milk.' (8.8 st pitch spread, 241 Hz) and lands at 3.52 s against 3.45 s. The tired tag flattened Cathy to a 5.1 st spread, which reads as monotone."
    }
